# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CrisisConnect Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your API key:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The app works in 3 modes:
#   1. FEATHERLESS MODE (online + API key) — LLM-powered triage
#   2. OFFLINE MODE (Transformers.js) — Runs in browser, no internet
#   3. FALLBACK MODE (rule-based) — Instant, always works
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Your Featherless AI API key (free from hackathon sponsor)
VITE_FEATHERLESS_API_KEY=your_featherless_api_key_here
